WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
If your prep is PEG, this video will walk you through exactly how to take it

2
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:03.920
.

3
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:08.220
Just follow along step by step. Your PEG prep is the large container that you'll

4
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:08.960
mix with water.

5
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.640
You'll also want Crystal Light or flavor packs on hand if you'd like to improve

6
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:13.120
the taste.

7
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.600
At 8 AM, the day before your procedure, you'll mix the prep.

8
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.220
Add water to your prep container and stir or shake until everything is fully

9
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.000
dissolved.

10
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.660
Once it's mixed, put it in the refrigerator. Keeping it cold makes it much

11
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:27.760
easier to drink.

12
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:31.440
If you're adding Crystal Light or a flavor pack, you can mix that in now.

13
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:35.490
Just make sure it's not red, orange, blue, or purple. Stick to clear or light-colored

14
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:36.080
flavors.

15
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.640
Between 4 and 5 PM, you'll begin drinking the solution.

16
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:45.760
Here's the pace. Drink 16 ounces. That's about two cups every 30 minutes.

17
00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:49.840
You'll keep going at that pace for about 4 hours until the entire container

18
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:50.320
is empty.

19
00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:55.530
Take your time with each glass. Slow, steady sips are easier on your stomach

20
00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.080
than trying to

21
00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:00.800
gulp it all at once. This part is really important. You must drink all of the

22
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.120
prep

23
00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.320
solution as directed, even if you're already passing clear liquid.

24
00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:08.800
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

25
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:09.360
the clearest

26
00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:14.930
view during your procedure. If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may

27
00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:16.080
need to reschedule,

28
00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:20.380
and neither of us wants that. Once you've finished, keep drinking clear liquids

29
00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.040
until bedtime.

30
00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:26.800
Staying hydrated will help you feel better and help the prep do its job. If you

31
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:27.440
experience any

32
00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:31.110
discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying a petroleum-based ointment

33
00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:31.840
or diaper

34
00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:36.630
rash cream can really help. That's it. You've got this. Follow the timing,

35
00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:37.840
finish the full dose,

36
00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:42.140
and stay hydrated. If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our

37
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.520
office. We're here to help.
